{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-1","title":"2 Chronicles 14:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Asa succeeding, destroys idolatry. 6 Having peace, he strengthens his kingdom with forts and armies. 9 Calling on God, he overthrows Zerah, and spoils the Ethiopians.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3049. B.C. 955. slept. 9:31; 1Ki 2:10; 14:31 Asa. 1Ki 15:8-24; 1Ch 3:10; Mt 1:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-2","title":"2 Chronicles 14:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>A.M. 3063-3073. B.C. 941-931. good and right. 31:20; 1Ki 15:11,14; Lu 1:75</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-3","title":"2 Chronicles 14:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>For he took. De 7:5; 1Ki 11:7,8; 14:22-24 the high places. 15:17; Le 26:30; 1Ki 15:12-14 brake. 34:4; Ex 34:13; De 7:5,25 images. Heb. statue. 2Ki 23:14; *marg: cut down. Jud 6:25-28; 1Ki 11:7; 2Ki 18:4; 23:6,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-4","title":"2 Chronicles 14:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>commanded. 29:21,27,30; 30:12; 33:16; 34:32,33; Ge 18:19; Jos 24:15; 1Sa 3:13 Ezr 10:7-12; Ne 13:9,19-22; Ps 101:2-8 seek. 11:16; 30:19; Isa 55:6,7; Am 5:4 to do. Ne 10:29-39; Ps 119:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-5","title":"2 Chronicles 14:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>images. Heb. sun-images. 34:4; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-6","title":"2 Chronicles 14:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>And he built. 8:2-6; 11:5-12 for the land. Jud 3:11,30; 5:31; 1Ki 5:4; 1Ch 22:9 the Lord. 15:15; Jos 23:1; Job 34:29; Ps 46:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-7","title":"2 Chronicles 14:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Therefore. 32:5; Ac 9:31 while the land. Joh 9:4; 12:35,36; Heb 3:13-15 we have sought. 4; 1Ch 28:9; Ps 105:3,4; Jer 29:12-14; 1Pe 3:12 and he hath given. 6; Jos 23:1; Mt 11:28,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-8","title":"2 Chronicles 14:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>out of Judah. 11:1; 13:3; 17:14-19; 25:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-9","title":"2 Chronicles 14:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>A.M. 3063. B.C. 941. Zerah. 12:2,3; 16:8; 2Ki 19:9; Isa 8:9,10; Eze 30:5; Re 16:14 Mareshah. Jos 15:44; Mic 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-10","title":"2 Chronicles 14:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Zephathah. Jos 19:4; Jud 1:17 Zephath.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-11","title":"2 Chronicles 14:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>cried unto. 13:14; 18:31; 32:20; Ex 14:10; 1Ch 5:20; Ps 18:6; 22:5; 34:6; 50:15 Ps 91:15; 120:1; Ac 2:21 nothing. Le 26:8; De 32:30; Jud 7:7; 1Sa 14:6; 1Ki 20:27-30; Am 5:9 2Co 12:9,10 them that. 20:12; De 32:36; Isa 40:29-31 rest on thee. 32:8; 1Sa 17:35,36; Ps 37:5; Pr 18:10; Isa 26:3,4; 41:10-14 Joh 14:1,27; Ro 8:31 in thy name. 13:12,18; 1Sa 17:45,46; Ps 20:5,7; Isa 26:13; Ac 3:16 man. or, mortal man. De 32:27; Jos 7:8,9; 1Sa 2:9; Ps 9:19; 79:9,10; Isa 2:22; Jer 1:19 Zec 2:8; Mt 16:18; Ac 9:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-12","title":"2 Chronicles 14:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>13:15; 20:22; Ex 14:25; De 28:7; 32:39; Jos 10:10; Ps 60:12 Ps 136:17,18; 1Co 9:26; 15:57</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-13","title":"2 Chronicles 14:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Gerar. 14; Ge 10:1,19; 20:1; 26:1 destroyed. Heb. broken. before the Lord. Job 6:9; 9:4; 2Th 1:9 his host. Jos 5:14; 1Sa 25:28; 1Ch 12:22; Ps 108:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-14","title":"2 Chronicles 14:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the fear. 17:10; 20:29; Ge 35:5; De 2:25; Jos 2:9-11,24; 5:1; 1Sa 14:15 2Ki 7:6; Job 15:21; Ps 48:5,6; Isa 31:9 exceeding. 20:25; Jud 14:19; 2Ki 7:7,8,16; Ps 68:12; Isa 33:23; Ro 8:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ch-14-15","title":"2 Chronicles 14:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CH","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the tents of cattle. 1Ch 4:41 carried away. Nu 31:9,30-47; 1Sa 30:20; 1Ch 5:21</p>"}]}